{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Broken Land. Scattered Magic. Fuzzy Paws. One bookish cat must save a paper world from being ripped apart.\u00a0</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/f58060b8aa761ed4139ab29fad90ac05.avif?t=1771871438\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras_big/f58060b8aa761ed4139ab29fad90ac05.webp?t=1771871438 width=1560 height=374 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As Elemental Master Juniper Von Umbravox (Or Junie for short) adventure through a shattered world where biomes and critter cultures have collided as a result of warring elemental gods. Junie must cleverly combine their wand pieces to create spells to repair the world, calm monsters, and help the inhabitants.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/8345976dc7be2638e12d565e997599d8.avif?t=1771871438\" width=800 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whiskers Wizards and Wands is a whimsical and cozy adventure game, where you take on the role of a Wizard Cat who interacts with the world around them via a customizable wand. Fight enemies, find secret treasures, design novel spell combinations, and help repair a world that has been broken and scrambled. All of this magic takes place within a completely hand-drawn world. That's right, every image was drawn with markers on paper before being placed into the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/eb98d8c0a1eaec3c2828a2f5b9b35749.poster.avif?t=1771871438\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/eb98d8c0a1eaec3c2828a2f5b9b35749.webm?t=1771871438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/eb98d8c0a1eaec3c2828a2f5b9b35749.mp4?t=1771871438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn paper illustrations, and a papery-feel world gives a unique look to the entire game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 5 different zones each with unique creatures, puzzle mechanics and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle monsters and exploit their weaknesses with quick swapping wand load outs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and unlock secret areas with extra treasures.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find collectables to unlock additional outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy story with funny and relatable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautifully arranged score with orchestral and electronic elements by Dr. Jamie Wind Whitmarsh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple drag and drop wand system to customize hundreds of spells from blasting an enemy to creating useful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/b5315ae2748ca53a3476e4349c440aad.poster.avif?t=1771871438\" width=352 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/b5315ae2748ca53a3476e4349c440aad.webm?t=1771871438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/b5315ae2748ca53a3476e4349c440aad.mp4?t=1771871438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588160?t=1771871438","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588160?t=1771871438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/cd0bdbafb0718179b9c432a09b72f40afba66ff1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771871438","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/cd0bdbafb0718179b9c432a09b72f40afba66ff1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771871438","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4040410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Broken Land. Scattered Magic. Fuzzy Paws. One bookish cat must save a paper world from being ripped apart.\u00a0</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/f58060b8aa761ed4139ab29fad90ac05.avif?t=1771871438\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras_big/f58060b8aa761ed4139ab29fad90ac05.webp?t=1771871438 width=1560 height=374 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As Elemental Master Juniper Von Umbravox (Or Junie for short) adventure through a shattered world where biomes and critter cultures have collided as a result of warring elemental gods. Junie must cleverly combine their wand pieces to create spells to repair the world, calm monsters, and help the inhabitants.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/8345976dc7be2638e12d565e997599d8.avif?t=1771871438\" width=800 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whiskers Wizards and Wands is a whimsical and cozy adventure game, where you take on the role of a Wizard Cat who interacts with the world around them via a customizable wand. Fight enemies, find secret treasures, design novel spell combinations, and help repair a world that has been broken and scrambled. All of this magic takes place within a completely hand-drawn world. That's right, every image was drawn with markers on paper before being placed into the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/eb98d8c0a1eaec3c2828a2f5b9b35749.poster.avif?t=1771871438\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/eb98d8c0a1eaec3c2828a2f5b9b35749.webm?t=1771871438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/eb98d8c0a1eaec3c2828a2f5b9b35749.mp4?t=1771871438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn paper illustrations, and a papery-feel world gives a unique look to the entire game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 5 different zones each with unique creatures, puzzle mechanics and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle monsters and exploit their weaknesses with quick swapping wand load outs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and unlock secret areas with extra treasures.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find collectables to unlock additional outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy story with funny and relatable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautifully arranged score with orchestral and electronic elements by Dr. Jamie Wind Whitmarsh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple drag and drop wand system to customize hundreds of spells from blasting an enemy to creating useful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/b5315ae2748ca53a3476e4349c440aad.poster.avif?t=1771871438\" width=352 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/b5315ae2748ca53a3476e4349c440aad.webm?t=1771871438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/extras/b5315ae2748ca53a3476e4349c440aad.mp4?t=1771871438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Sweet and Power Sauce"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588160/136da04206f59238b48e488c34cdd75520e49b81/header.jpg?t=1771871438","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3588160/374318064/559f3403490b8074779